<%- include('partials/header') %>

    <body class="public-page">
        <%- include('partials/public-nav') %>

            <main class="info-page">
                <div class="info-inner info-legal">
                    <h1>Regulatory Compliance</h1>
                    <p class="info-sub">Willow Banking Corp. is committed to meeting and exceeding all applicable
                        regulatory requirements.</p>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>Regulatory Framework</h2>
                        <p>We operate in compliance with all applicable federal and state banking regulations, including
                            but not limited to:</p>
                        <div class="info-grid">
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h3>BSA / AML</h3>
                                <p>Full compliance with the Bank Secrecy Act and Anti-Money Laundering regulations,
                                    including transaction monitoring and suspicious activity reporting.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h3>KYC Requirements</h3>
                                <p>Robust Know Your Customer procedures are implemented for all account openings and
                                    high-value transactions.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h3>FDIC Insured</h3>
                                <p>Deposits are insured up to $250,000 per depositor, per account category, through the
                                    Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h3>PCI DSS</h3>
                                <p>Our card processing systems comply with Payment Card Industry Data Security Standards
                                    to protect cardholder data.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>Data Protection</h2>
                        <p>We adhere to strict data protection standards:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>SOC 2 Type II</strong> — Annual third-party audits verify our security controls
                            </li>
                            <li><strong>GLBA Compliance</strong> — Customer financial information is protected under the
                                Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act</li>
                            <li><strong>CCPA Ready</strong> — California Consumer Privacy Act rights are fully supported
                            </li>
                            <li><strong>GDPR Aligned</strong> — Our data practices align with EU General Data Protection
                                Regulation principles</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>Audit & Oversight</h2>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Annual independent security audits</li>
                            <li>Continuous transaction monitoring for suspicious activity</li>
                            <li>Complete audit trail of all administrative actions</li>
                            <li>Regular penetration testing by third-party security firms</li>
                            <li>Employee training on compliance and security protocols</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>Reporting Concerns</h2>
                        <p>If you suspect fraud, money laundering, or any regulatory violation, please contact our
                            compliance team immediately at <strong>compliance@willowbank.com</strong> or call <strong>+1
                                (555) 012-3456</strong>. All reports are treated confidentially.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
    </body>

    </html>